/Title (The Azure Dragon of the East is simultaneously a divine creature and a star quadrant: seven specific lunar mansions in Virgo, Libra, Scorpius, and Sagittarius trace its shape across the eastern sky. Its rising in spring marks the beginning of the farming year; its heart-star \(Antares\) rising in summer marks the summer solstice. The Shiji documents both the creature and the star system in the same astronomical treatise.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 714 0 R
>>
